#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:66 2f4f18cf039440a699dec0811e4d9d32
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the FDA medical device enforcement (recall) "
"database via openFDA. Contains medical device recalls, corrections, and "
"removals. Use Lucene query syntax: 'classification:\"Class I\"' (most "
"serious), 'status:Ongoing', 'recalling\\_firm:\"Medtronic\"'. Returns "
"recall details including product description, reason for recall, and "
"distribution pattern. Medical devices include implants, diagnostic "
"equipment, surgical tools, and consumer medical devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:70 688b3a2f6f9e4621b13d06ad81072bac
msgid ""
"``search`` (string, null) (optional) Lucene query for device recalls "
"(e.g., 'classification:\"Class I\"', 'status:Ongoing', "
"'product\\_description:pacemaker', 'recalling\\_firm:medtronic'). Leave "
"null to get recent recalls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:76 37aba20cb373429e8161e2bf4474adf3
msgid ""
"``count`` (string, null) (optional) Field to count by (e.g., "
"'classification', 'status', 'recalling\\_firm.exact')"
msgstr ""

