#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:138 f6eb3ae690354d3ab92c36a01ebe54cc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the FDA Adverse Event Reporting System (FAERS) "
"database via openFDA for drug safety reports. Accepts convenience "
"parameters drug\\_name and reaction (e.g., drug\\_name='warfarin', "
"reaction='haemorrhage'), or a raw Lucene 'search' string for advanced "
"queries. Contains 20+ million adverse event reports. IMPORTANT: MedDRA "
"reaction terms use British English spelling (e.g., 'haemorrhage' not "
"'hemorrhage', 'haematoma' not 'hematoma'). Returns serious adverse events"
" with outcomes (hospitalization, death), suspect drugs, and MedDRA "
"reactions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:142 adce64b3af034a528fccd0beba50fff6
msgid ""
"``search`` (string) (optional) Lucene query for adverse event reports. "
"Use AND/OR with spaces (not +AND+). Examples: "
"'patient.drug.medicinalproduct:aspirin', "
"'patient.reaction.reactionmeddrapt:\"myocardial infarction\"', 'serious:1"
" AND patient.drug.medicinalproduct:warfarin'. Combine drugs: "
"'patient.drug.medicinalproduct:metformin AND "
"patient.drug.medicinalproduct:atorvastatin'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:145 a414ea6461d544958e48a6a51788713b
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum number of reports to return "
"(default 1, max 100)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:148 bb49fca351e1470fb7d67ba6b85ad69a
msgid ""
"``count`` (string, null) (optional) Field to count by for frequency "
"analysis (e.g., 'patient.reaction.reactionmeddrapt.exact' to get most "
"common reactions)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:151 82d034dbdc354426a2946c1f1b5ce3e6
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string, null) (optional) Drug name to search for adverse "
"events (e.g., 'warfarin', 'metformin'). Alternative to writing a full "
"Lucene 'search' query."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:154 176e31471e0e4db4bb0b6c209c98238b
msgid ""
"``reaction`` (string, null) (optional) MedDRA adverse reaction term "
"(British spelling: 'haemorrhage' not 'hemorrhage', 'haematoma' not "
"'hematoma'). Used with drug\\_name to filter by reaction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openfda_tools.rst:157 9fc07bac5d5b492f90762a9d8ac66e7a
msgid ""
"``adverse_event`` (string, null) (optional) Alias for reaction. MedDRA "
"adverse reaction term (British spelling)."
msgstr ""

